Origin

Canopy Community is a modified version of Proma
(https://github.com/proma-ai/Proma), which is licensed under the GNU Affero
General Public License v3.0. Copyright in the original work remains with the
Proma authors.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications (2026)

Notable changes relative to Proma include:

- Renamed the product and its identifiers; separate application id and data
  directory (~/.canopy-community/).
- Restructured the agent layer into a runtime-agnostic kernel
  (packages/kernel), a Pi runtime plugin (packages/runtime-pi) and business
  packages for automation and IM bridges.
- Added built-in Office document tools based on OfficeCLI, legacy .doc / .xls
  / .ppt reading, PSD reading / composing / editing, and the canopy-ppt and
  canopy-psd skills.
- Extended file previews: lazily rendered and searchable PDF, virtualized large
  spreadsheets, legacy Office formats, editable Markdown tables, math, outline.
- Reworked plan approval, terminal output flow control, run persistence and
  recovery, focus handling of the side panel, and many UI details (layout
  scale, color themes, title bar).
- Removed automatic updates and the in-app release channel.

The complete history of changes in this repository is available in its git log.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components

The agent runtime is built on Pi (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), MIT.
Third-party components keep their own licenses:
- OfficeCLI (https://github.com/iOfficeAI/OfficeCLI), Apache-2.0. Not stored
  in this repository; the build downloads a pinned release and verifies its
  SHA-256 before bundling it.
- guizang-ppt-skill, MIT; skill-creator, Apache-2.0 (license files are in
  their skill directories).
- UI sound effects and illustrations, CC0 1.0.
